# Line-ending invariant for the StockerPro repository.
#
# The machine-global git config sets core.autocrlf=true
# (C:/Software/Git/etc/gitconfig), which rewrites LF -> CRLF on checkout and
# would leak CRLF into committed files on this host.  This file overrides
# that globally: all text files are stored and checked out as LF, no BOM.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary